e","donor_constant":"60000","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/EQEmu/zone/mob.cpp:8582"},{"name":"client_update_range","donor_constant":"600 (zone table default)","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/EQEmu/common/database/database_update_manifest.h:6323"}],"best_idea":"Gate every NPC's per-tick processing on zone presence, with a zone-data grace window after the last player leaves and explicit exceptions for quest-driven and path-while-idle NPCs.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The presence gate with a grace window fits Frankendom's zones-as-data and its per-tick NPC budget (row 18 sub-line), but the donor's close-list rebuild is a full mob-list scan and its distance lookup falls back to the whole list above 600 units; Frankendom keeps the gate, replaces the scan with a per-zone grid, and checks the NPC kind before reading NPC fields.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A zone with 200 NPCs and one player: when the player leaves, NPC AI and movement continue for graceSeconds (zone data, default 60) and then stop; a path-while-idle patrol keeps moving; a player who re-enters restarts processing within one tick; with grace 0 a fight in progress keeps its NPCs running."}
